	<data name="Terms_S9_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>The lawllit. brand, design, interface, and code of lawllit.finance are the property of the developer. The financial data you record is your property. No part of the service may be reproduced, distributed, or used commercially without express authorization.</value></data>
